Big Mom's back! Help me!

270
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,332
Last time was a miracle!

271
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:50,877
We'd die in a real fight!

272
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,019
What should we do?

273
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:56,900
Big Mom aside, we're outnumbered badly.

274
00:18:57,460 --> 00:18:59,140
If we stop, we're dead.

275
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:00,640
Just try to escape!

276
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:04,750
Die!

277
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,077
First in line, baby! Let's do this!

278
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,700
I'm going to wreck those losers so hard!

279
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:11,600
Hey, guys, who's our enemy?

280
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,588
It's the Straw Hats, dummy.

281
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,040
Oh, that's right.

282
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:18,177
I'm not seeing any Straw
Hats on that ship, though.

283
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:20,960
Excuse me, where did the Straw Hats go?

284
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,917
That way, but you gotta hurry.

285
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,830
Really?

286
00:19:23,913 --> 00:19:25,300
You heard her. Go!

287
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,915
Thanks a bunch, lady.

288
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:29,700
Uh, I think I'm gonna fall.

289
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,800
What were they?

290
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:36,560
How would I know?

291
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,340
Bunch of morons!

292
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:44,117
What's the point of thinking
cannonballs if they're all stupid?

293
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,637
Why'd they turn like that?

294
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:50,073
Well, you know, when Mama's not in her
right mind, they get kind of funny.

295
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:51,150
Let me go!

296
00:19:51,233 --> 00:19:52,063
I'm ready to rock!

297
00:19:52,146 --> 00:19:53,480
I was born ready!

298
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,040
Please, Baba Wah!

299
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,495
If I can't explode, I'm gonna explode!

300
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:00,450
Damn it!

301
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:04,641
We're going at full speed here,
and Mama hasn't slowed down either.

302
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:07,760
Why can't we catch these pumps?

303
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:13,640
Probably because they have Jinbei
and he knows the sea so well.

304
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:20,200
Bugawa, sir, we just got a cold.

305
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:22,820
It's time.

306
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:25,720
Big trouble!

307
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:27,792
What do you see, Carrot?

308
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:30,116
There's a whole bunch of ships ahead.

309
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:33,360
An ambush?

310
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:35,700
Curse it all.

311
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:36,960
We're trapped.

312
00:20:41,020 --> 00:20:44,420
I can almost taste that wedding cake.

313
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:02,760
Third gear, go!

314
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:12,849
Are you looking to burn
yourself out again?

315
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:18,777
No one would have blamed
you if you ran away,

316
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:22,337
not with me as your opponent—you
had the perfect chance.

317
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:25,257
Why did you come back?

318
00:21:25,340 --> 00:21:30,257
So you would sooner choose death
than live with the shame of running?

319
00:21:30,340 --> 00:21:31,170
running

320
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:34,340
You said I'm gonna die!

321
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:37,293
Then, knowing that you cannot defeat me,

322
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:39,317
you've come to beg that
we accept you as an

323
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:41,988
ally hoping to save
your friends from death.

324
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:44,640
I'm not begging!

325
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:49,080
I already told you.

326
00:21:50,220 --> 00:21:51,420
I'm here to fight!

327
00:21:52,380 --> 00:21:54,860
And I'm going to kick your ass!

328
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,940
You still think you can win?

329
00:22:05,740 --> 00:22:07,380
I've made it quite clear.

330
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:12,260
That's not possible.

331
00:22:27,020 --> 00:22:27,850
Curses.

332
00:22:27,933 --> 00:22:30,698
I feared we'd encounter more
enemies sooner or later,

333
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:34,100
but I'd hope that we'd lose Big Mom first.

334
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:36,600
Baba-wa, sir!

335
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:41,680
A fleet led by Minister Daifugo has
arrived right in front of the Straw Hats.

336
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:45,220
We have reinforcements from
behind, too. Who is it?

337
00:22:46,220 --> 00:22:47,920
Ah, I see.

338
00:22:48,940 --> 00:22:53,040
Sweet General Smoothie is pulling
in with an entire fleet of ships.

339
00:22:55,220 --> 00:22:56,197
Even better,

340
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:59,577
it seems that she is lady citron and
lady cinnamon on her flagship as well.

341
00:22:59,660 --> 00:23:01,197
We're unstoppable now.

342
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:03,597
The enemy's toast—kind of overkill.

343
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:08,317
Better an easy victory than
a narrow one. Am I right?

344
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:10,697
Fine, let's go.

345
00:23:10,780 --> 00:23:11,637
Wipe them out.

346
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:17,977
What's going on here, pearls?

347
00:23:18,060 --> 00:23:19,857
You've got mama with you.

348
00:23:19,940 --> 00:23:21,377
Why haven't you sunk these rats already?

349
00:23:21,460 --> 00:23:23,397
Can I take them out?

350
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:26,397
Do whatever you lickety like.

351
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,310
I've

352
00:23:27,540 --> 00:23:28,677
had more than enough action.

353
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:29,590
Thank you.

354
00:23:29,673 --> 00:23:31,777
We're going to cacao island pudding.

355
00:23:31,860 --> 00:23:34,737
Should be waiting for mama
there with wedding cake.

356
00:23:34,820 --> 00:23:39,737
Seems like mama's getting
a bit lickety skinny.

357
00:23:39,820 --> 00:23:41,197
What a mess.

358
00:23:41,280 --> 00:23:42,110
I

359
00:23:43,860 --> 00:23:46,757
will have my damn cake!

360
00:23:46,840 --> 00:23:47,670
All

361
00:23:48,380 --> 00:23:50,137
ships, prepare to fire.

362
00:23:50,220 --> 00:23:51,050
As

363
00:23:54,860 --> 00:23:59,077
soon as the Straw Hats come within
range, obliterate the punks!

364
00:23:59,160 --> 00:23:59,990
punks

365
00:24:00,360 --> 00:24:01,620
Is this scary?

366
00:24:02,100 --> 00:24:05,335
Daifugo ships are getting
ready to shoot their cannons.

367
00:24:05,820 --> 00:24:09,377
I don't think we're in their firing
range, not for the time being at least.

368
00:24:09,460 --> 00:24:11,820
Yet we have no choice but to advance.

369
00:24:12,180 --> 00:24:14,886
The other enemies will
block us on every side.

370
00:24:16,040 --> 00:24:18,877
If that's the case, then we might
as well confront them directly.

371
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,357
Maintain our current speed!

372
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:22,793
I warn you, Daifugo is quite formidable.

373
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:26,397
You should be very careful
when contending with his genie.

374
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:29,200
We must reunite with Sanji at any cost.

375
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:31,576
We will rise to the occasion somehow.

376
00:24:32,020 --> 00:24:32,850
Agreed.

377
00:24:32,933 --> 00:24:34,320
Now let's prepare for a fight.

378
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:38,214
If I take a rumble ball, then
I can do some real damage.

379
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:41,917
Pull in close, then I'll jump
onto their ship and go berserk.

380
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,080
It'll be tough.

381
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:45,301
The close range is our best shot.

382
00:24:46,620 --> 00:24:47,480
I'm ready.

383
00:24:50,780 --> 00:24:53,133
They're gonna try to close the distance.

384
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:56,861
Fire every shell to make
sure they never reach us.

385
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:59,740
We're gonna start some chaos!

386
00:25:00,280 --> 00:25:04,200
But let's use the normal
cannonballs, okay? No more!

387
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,380
Get the magic!

388
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:07,350
Chopra!

389
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:09,160
No! Listen!

390
00:25:10,500 --> 00:25:12,280
I can handle this!

391
00:25:12,460 --> 00:25:13,560
Let me fight them!

392
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:14,910
What?

393
00:25:14,993 --> 00:25:16,960
This is finally my chance!

394
00:25:17,420 --> 00:25:19,120
I'm confused here.

395
00:25:21,460 --> 00:25:22,520
Look up!

396
00:25:24,180 --> 00:25:26,020
It's a full moon tonight!

397
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:29,960
Don't tell me you're turning too long.

398
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:32,751
Have you been trained to do that properly?

399
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:34,600
Don't worry.

400
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:37,180
Pedro taught me all I need.

401
00:25:39,180 --> 00:25:41,415
If he were here, I know what he'd say.

402
00:25:42,900 --> 00:25:44,500
Leave everything to me.

403
00:25:45,300 --> 00:25:47,957
If you're gonna fight those
guys, then I will too.

404
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:50,040
I can handle it, I promise.

405
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:54,900
After all, I'm a musketeer, aren't I?

406
00:25:56,340 --> 00:25:57,637
They're almost here.

407
00:25:57,720 --> 00:26:00,740
Fire salvos and we'll
sink them in an instant.

408
00:26:01,360 --> 00:26:03,300
Now, wait for my cue!

409
00:26:05,660 --> 00:26:07,800
What do you mean, Pedro?

410
00:26:08,560 --> 00:26:12,360
One day, Yugara will understand
the decision that I've made.

411
00:26:12,740 --> 00:26:17,820
Know it was to keep Luffy and his crew
alive so they can continue onward.

412
00:26:18,780 --> 00:26:22,520
I'll keep fighting on your behalf, Pedro.

413
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,240
Watch me.

414
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,520
What's that line?

415
00:27:15,740 --> 00:27:17,620
Oh, my God.

416
00:27:51,540 --> 00:27:53,420
Her eyes turn bright red.

417
00:27:53,620 --> 00:27:55,326
Doesn't look like her at all.

418
00:27:55,860 --> 00:27:57,120
So beautiful.

419
00:27:57,600 --> 00:27:58,800
Wow, Carrot.

420
00:27:59,100 --> 00:28:01,440
It's quite mesmerizing, isn't it?

421
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:05,217
I've never seen such a thing now.

422
00:28:05,300 --> 00:28:07,237
If I could only see her panties as well.

423
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:12,240
I see, so this is what Duke
dog storm was talking about.

424
00:28:13,360 --> 00:28:14,957
We underestimated the enemy.

425
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:17,597
Jack alone was too much for us.

426
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:21,557
It only took one of Kaido's
troops to leave us in this state.

427
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:27,237
We shall not make the same mistake next
time, from now on we'll be prepared.

428
00:28:27,320 --> 00:28:32,480
They shall soon realize they have
yet to see our full potential.

429
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:35,560
as we still have one
final ace up our sleeve.

430
00:28:36,040 --> 00:28:40,837
I couldn't have guessed what he meant at
the time, but this would certainly qualify.

431
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,880
The true power of the Minx.

432
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:45,020
So the full moon did this?

433
00:28:58,860 --> 00:29:00,817
Wait, is that what I think it is?

434
00:29:00,900 --> 00:29:04,057
I've got bad news, Minister Daifugo.

435
00:29:04,140 --> 00:29:05,837
It's a full moon tonight.

436
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:08,157
And the Straw Hats have a meet with them.

437
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:11,000
She went so long.

438
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:14,470
Crap!

439
00:29:14,553 --> 00:29:17,140
All troops prepare for
a close quarters battle.

440
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:20,717
She must be from the phantom island,

441
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:26,420
like Pedro might be just as deadly in
this state, probably? Probably more so.

442
00:29:35,580 --> 00:29:37,345
She's gonna fall in the water!

443
00:29:38,860 --> 00:29:40,740
Whoa, what the heck?

444
00:29:41,020 --> 00:29:43,620
Is she skimming on the
surface of the water?

445
00:29:47,020 --> 00:29:48,000
That's cool!

446
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:51,094
Save your surprise for what comes next.

447
00:29:52,760 --> 00:29:53,780
This is it!

448
00:29:54,100 --> 00:29:55,100
Shoot her down!

449
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,220
Show no mercy.

450
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:58,677
She's a warrior from Zou.

451
00:29:58,760 --> 00:29:59,936
This might be tough.

452
00:30:02,180 --> 00:30:04,160
I got this. Check me out.

453
00:30:05,580 --> 00:30:06,580
What the hell?

454
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:11,820
Keep firing.

455
00:30:12,380 --> 00:30:13,210
Kill her.

456
00:30:26,620 --> 00:30:28,220
Not bad! Fire!

457
00:30:34,760 --> 00:30:36,280
I got you now!

458
00:31:02,760 --> 00:31:03,760
No fear.

459
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:06,631
At least tell me what's going on, Chopper.

460
00:31:10,320 --> 00:31:11,900
Hey, you little rat.

461
00:31:12,360 --> 00:31:14,917
Think you can take down
the whole fleet like that?

462
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:16,160
Might take a while.

463
00:31:16,840 --> 00:31:20,057
While you're busy, there's nothing
stopping us from sinking your ship.

464
00:31:20,140 --> 00:31:22,360
So why don't you calm down and...

465
00:31:24,100 --> 00:31:25,180
Wait a second.

466
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,320
Ah! Whoa!

467
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:30,700
She broke the steering
wheel right off! I'm good!

468
00:31:31,100 --> 00:31:32,924
The ship is turning on its own!

469
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:36,280
You think you're a
clever rabbit, don't ya?
